    "title": "City Council member Monica Robinson looks to bridge the gap between JMU and Harrisonburg - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sara Helwe Paget ,\n1 days ago\nLongtime Harrisonburg resident and Double Duke, incumbent councilmember Monica Robinson works at the intersection of Harrisonburg and JMU. Looking to serve a second term, Robinson is up for reelection in the Nov. 3 midterm City Council election, running against incumbent Dany Fleming, Sal Romero and write-in candidate Heri Cortes for two open seats.\nRead full article\n1",
